title: "Game Theory in a Circuit: Adaptive Spectral Camouflage for Mixed-Signal Side Channels"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible simulator and command-line tool (ascam) that tests whether a
  device can randomize its clock hopping and dummy noise so an adaptive
  eavesdropper learns less, without spending too much energy. Defensive
  research code: all secrets are synthetic.
type: software
